{"updated":"2026-10-21T12:28:16.619Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"Det7CS2EwqO","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Det7CS2EwqO","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"@leo.malilion 我的AI助手👋 threads.com/@leo…","timestamp":"2026-10-20T13:18:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DerajejE32g","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DerajejE32g","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"做了一個帝王模擬器遊戲 會有人想玩嗎？？","timestamp":"2026-10-19T13:55:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeqmqapADtG","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DeqmqapADtG","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"我把沙子、岩漿、液態氮，甚至黑洞，全部塞進一個 HTML 檔案裡了！🧪\n\n最近做了一個叫 PixelChem的像素物理化學沙盒遊戲\n\n它不是單純播放動畫，而是讓每個像素都有自己的物理與化學反應\n\n🌋 岩漿碰到水會生成黑曜石，蒸氣還能凝結成雨\n\n⚡ 閃電可以沿著水和金屬傳導，引爆整排火藥\n\n🧊 液態氮能讓水結冰，鋁熱劑則能熔穿金屬\n\n🌀 黑洞會吸走周圍像素，甚至能把重力反轉！\n\n還內建 4 種實驗場景：火山生態、酸液迷宮、連環爆破塔、水力閃電迴路。\n\n最有趣的是，整個遊戲只用一個 `index.html`，靠原生 HTML、CSS、JavaScript 與元胞自動機實現，不需要框架或建置工具。\n\n還支援熱像儀、氣流視覺化、截圖與錄影。\n\n你會先研究物理反應，還是直接把整張地圖炸掉？","timestamp":"2026-10-19T06:24:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Deqm4rNkypq","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Deqm4rNkypq","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🎮 線上體驗：\nmalilion.github.io/Pixel…","timestamp":"2026-10-19T06:24:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeqgXimEyAe","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DeqgXimEyAe","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Claude Code 開放 mods 兩週多了，\n很多人第一次看到它，是有人在 Claude Code 裡做出俄羅斯方塊。\n\n但重點不是 Tetris，\n是你現在可以改 Claude Code 自己的 harness。\n\nmod 是一段 JS／TS，直接跑在 Claude Code 裡面：\n1️⃣ 改寫 prompt、攔下或改寫 tool call\n2️⃣ 在介面加 pane、按鈕、自己的 /command\n3️⃣ 幫 subagent 換模型，或把某個請求丟給別的模型\n\n官方自己的 /diff、AGENTS.md 支援，也是用 mod 寫的。\n\n但先知道一件事：\nmod 沒有 sandbox，跑起來就是你的權限。\n讀得到你的檔案、環境變數裡的 API key，也看得到每個 prompt。\n\n所以裝之前我會先做兩件事：\n✅ 用 claude plugin validate 看它掛了哪些事件、要做什麼\n✅ 只從信得過的作者和 marketplace 裝\n\n你會先改 UI，還是先改 execution loop？\n連結放留言 👇","timestamp":"2026-10-19T05:27:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeqgXhTk_Wp","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DeqgXhTk_Wp","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"官方文件：code.claude.com/docs…\n官方範例 mods（token-weather、blast-radius、replay-theater）：github.com/anthr…\n\n終端機要 Claude Code v2.1.287 以上，預設就開著。\n想全部關掉：在 ~/.claude/settings.json 設 \"disableAllHooks\": true，或單次用 --safe-mode 啟動。","timestamp":"2026-10-19T05:27:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DewW6NAiVl0","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DewW6NAiVl0","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"現在已經進入10後整頓 Kpop 的時代了嗎？\n\n最近出道的 A2O LITE 平均年齡僅15歲\n詳見成員出生年份：\n\n・YOUNG（2008年）\n・HIMEKI（2009年）\n・VORA（2010年）\n・XILI（2010年）\n・MERCI（2011年）\n・RADA（2011年）\n・AYUNE（2013年）\n・AIJING（2013年）\n・OA（2013年）\n\n大家可以接受年紀這麼小的愛豆嗎？\n留言分享年紀輕輕就震撼 Kpop 的愛豆吧\n( *¯ ³¯*)♡","timestamp":"2026-10-21T12:00:15.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":16,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T20:29:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewW7WBCSK-","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DewW7WBCSK-","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"所以我老了嗎？\n原文來自✨#閒聊 韓團年齡愈來愈小能接受嗎？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多 Kpop 的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-21T12:00:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T20:29:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewJQp4Addj","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DewJQp4Addj","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"休沐了些許，本宮今日又回脆上海巡了\n\n各宮小主可有什麼甄嬛梗圖，\n速速呈上來給本宮過目。","timestamp":"2026-10-21T10:00:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":20,"replies":4,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":28,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T20:29:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewJR4ogcQf","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DewJR4ogcQf","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B1：\n還有甄嬛小產後人都躺瘦了➡️瘦瘦甄\n菀貴人跳驚鴻舞➡️菀Aden大跳\n長得像已故的純元皇后➡️類故純\n超好笑😂😂😂","timestamp":"2026-10-21T10:01:09.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T20:29:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewJTDSgdy6","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DewJTDSgdy6","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B3：息肌丸➡️大清猛健樂","timestamp":"2026-10-21T10:01:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T20:29:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewJULFAfi_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DewJULFAfi_","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B4：浣碧跟著果郡王走：咚帶我走","timestamp":"2026-10-21T10:01:28.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T20:29:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Det_2dLDPo4","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Det_2dLDPo4","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"小編剛滑到這篇\n原 PO 揭露了「金牛座的真實感情觀」♉️\n\n金牛座其實不如想像中無害：\n1. 內心會偷偷幫伴侶打分數 不及格就換人\n2. 分手早就預謀好 絕對不吃回頭草\n3. 表面乖乖牌 其實私底下很重肉慾\n\n好奇問問大家\n覺得金牛座在感情裡真的這樣嗎？🤔","timestamp":"2026-10-20T14:00:17.000Z","stats":{"likes":46,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":7},"score":48,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Det_38BDKOZ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Det_38BDKOZ","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨金牛座的感情觀 （黑暗版）✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多星座的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-20T14:00:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DetyI1pgevC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DetyI1pgevC","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨ 為何很多地方的廁所都是坐式馬桶\n✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:00:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DetyHkhgbCp","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DetyHkhgbCp","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"小編剛看到卡友在討論公廁設計👀\n\n原 PO 覺得在外用「坐式馬桶」\n還要擦酒精、墊衛生紙超麻煩\n猜想多數人應該更愛乾淨俐落的「蹲式馬桶」\n但為何現在百貨公司或公共場所\n卻幾乎都以坐式居多呢？\n\n想問問大家出門在外\n是「蹲式派」還是「坐式派」呀？🚻","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:00:17.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":4,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":14,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DetrO8hkfRg","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DetrO8hkfRg","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨長大後才發現每個人衛生習慣不同\n✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:00:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DetrNyeEVMO","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DetrNyeEVMO","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"小編看到有卡友驚呼 長大後才發現\n每個人的「衛生習慣」差很大👀\n\n原 PO 說從小覺得天天刷牙洗澡是基本常識\n長大才發現身邊居然不少人不愛刷牙\n甚至還有同事是「兩天才洗一次澡」\n讓他大開眼界\n\n大家出社會後\n有遇過什麼讓人震驚的「獨特衛生習慣」嗎？","timestamp":"2026-10-20T10:59:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":12,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"DewF0QalBUd","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DewF0QalBUd","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"買電腦零件前，先在線上組一遍！BuildCores 用 3D 預覽主機、桌面與 RGB，也能檢查相容性、估算用電。基本組機免費，部分進階功能需付費；模擬不等於實測，哪些規格還得自己核對？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-21T09:30:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T20:29:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewF0uLlCR4","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DewF0uLlCR4","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-21T09:30:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T20:29:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Devx53mlCC5","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Devx53mlCC5","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"ChatGPT 的私人聊天不想留在一般紀錄裡？新「鎖定對話」可移出聊天紀錄與搜尋，以 PIN 解鎖，支援的手機也能用生物辨識。免費方案也在分批推送，哪些對話能鎖、換裝置又有哪些限制？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-21T06:36:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T20:29:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Devx6d7FN16","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Devx6d7FN16","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-21T06:36:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T20:29:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Devch7pFJxi","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Devch7pFJxi","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"汽車原理不用只啃手冊！Electude 把機械構造與電池管理做成 3D 動畫、互動課程和模擬診斷。展示模組可免費體驗，完整平台則是商業教育軟體，原站未支援中文；哪些內容適合先試玩？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-21T03:30:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T13:26:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DevcieBlNdD","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DevcieBlNdD","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-21T03:30:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T13:26:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DevIrmLEwdH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DevIrmLEwdH","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"匿名兔子 Space Bunny 揭曉，原來是 MiniMax M3.1 Flash！Plotly 資料分析測驗 43 題答對 41 題，但相較預覽版也更慢、成本更高。模型規格、評測取捨與使用管道一起看，別只看單一跑分。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:36:41.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T13:26:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DevIsF-k0hQ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DevIsF-k0hQ","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:36:45.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T13:26:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Det2I8zFE6J","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Det2I8zFE6J","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:35:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Det2IUelDaW","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Det2IUelDaW","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"掃描 PDF 想改字，先看 OCR 能力。PDNob 這篇實測涵蓋多語言、傾斜文件與表格，也能整理 PDF 重點。編輯器可買斷，但 AI 助理要另訂閱，7 天試用後會自動續訂；免費版又有哪些限制？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:35:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DethJv9FItw","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DethJv9FItw","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-20T09:32:02.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DethJTLlNpY","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DethJTLlNpY","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"葉師傅這次不只要打十個，還會遇上薩諾斯？創作者「魚羊做遊戲」把電影梗做成 Roguelike，同人遊戲得顧體力、閃避與防禦，賺金幣再升級。作者實玩後，哪些地方最容易翻車？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-20T09:31:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Detg1ABgXaI","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Detg1ABgXaI","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"希臘真是貓狗友善國家，我覺得甚至超越土耳其","timestamp":"2026-10-20T09:29:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DetM0lZlLw9","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DetM0lZlLw9","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-20T06:34:23.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DetMz83lD9b","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DetMz83lD9b","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"手把變小，按鍵不用跟著省？Xbox Nano 保留 18 個標準遊戲輸入，內建充電電池，也支援無線與藍牙。美國預購價 49.99 美元，11 月起陸續上市；各地售價、供應時間仍依當地公告。適合哪些玩家、還有哪些功能？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-20T06:34:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[{"id":"DeornCBjXc5","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DeornCBjXc5","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"一直以來覺得自己是個幸運的人，我沒有什麼特別的地方，但就是執行力很強，想到什麼做什麼，而且有很多天馬行空的想法。\n\n從去年五月，發現 AI語音模型差不多已經可以開始有點實用性了，就開始做 AI懶人報的 Podcast，解決自己的 AI FOMO 也幫助到很多人，但聽起來還是有非常多不自然的地方，最近也換了更自然的模型！\n\n幾週前，Opus 5.5 釋出已經到了做影片強到誇張的地步，並且幾乎可以 one shot 就可以 release 的階段。我立馬把流程大改，覺得好像可以應用在 YouTube 跟其他平台的經營了，同步也把影片丟到 Facebook，成效超乎異常的好。\n\n剛好入手了一台 Mac Mini，沒事就是不斷幫我做影片🚀\n\n這兩週社群流程到了一個不同的境界，最大的瓶頸就是等我review..\n\n兩週內追蹤數：\nYoutube: 3000 -> 破萬\nFB: 3000 -> 1.1 萬\nIG: 900 -> 2700\n\n在這個 AI Slop 泛濫的年代，我覺得做出來的東西有人看，真的是一件非常幸福且幸運的事！\n\n每都想到我的內容幫助到很多人，就更有動力繼續做下去了～！！","timestamp":"2026-10-18T12:27:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":380,"replies":32,"reposts":18,"shares":148},"score":498,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeornpLDQII","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DeornpLDQII","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"歡迎追蹤Youtube：\nyoutube.com/@ai.l…","timestamp":"2026-10-18T12:27:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DewMXjZnwfZ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DewMXjZnwfZ","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"笑死 GrokBot 的 server 果然有夠大\n拿來裝 n8n 也是綽綽有餘\n\n但 GrokBot 不是 n8n 一個好的部署歸屬\n\nGrokBot 只要閒置數分鐘就會讓電腦休眠\n所以 n8n 也會跟著失去作用\n最短的排程也無法讓主機保持 100% 在線\n\n但讓 GrokBot 可以調用 Claude, Codex, Gemini \n可以緩解一些 token 焦慮","timestamp":"2026-10-21T10:28:08.000Z","stats":{"likes":16,"replies":9,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":37,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T20:29:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DevguaMkej-","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DevguaMkej-","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"把 Grok Bot 訂閱回來玩玩看\n\n其實你不用手動自己建立 Bot\n聊一聊根據場景需要\n\n你直接請 Main Agent 幫你建立一個新的 Agent 就好\n要做網頁 -> 設計師 bot\n要寫程式 -> 工程師 bot\n整理 Gmail -> G家整理師 bot\n\n對於沒有建立過 AI Agent 或是新手\n這流程一定會覺得超級順暢，幾乎沒什麼阻力\n\n對我來說反而有點焦慮\n畫面上呈現資訊太少\n現在用什麼模型、消耗多少 token、Context 已經塞多少\n\n來研究研究怎麼弄出個 statusline = =","timestamp":"2026-10-21T04:06:47.000Z","stats":{"likes":27,"replies":10,"reposts":0,"shares":5},"score":47,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T13:26:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Des7xeKkdSQ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Des7xeKkdSQ","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"請大家告訴大家\n如果你的 Claude 還有重置券\n即將於 10/23 後到期\n\n一定要使用！\nClaude 的重置券非常珍貴\n\n另外提醒 Claude 的重置是不會重設時間的\n\n例如我週日本來就是 weekly limit reset\n假設我在明天使用重置卷\n就必須要在三天左右的時間燒完 weekly limit \n不然禮拜天就又 reset 了","timestamp":"2026-10-20T04:05:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":94,"replies":17,"reposts":4,"shares":75},"score":140,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Deq6FsPj-JH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Deq6FsPj-JH","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Iterm2 改版，現在原生支援 Claude Code 執行狀態\n\n以前也不是不行，只是要自己寫 hook 魔改...\n現在原生支援就是挺不錯\n\n實測用其他的 Codex CLI, agy, grok build, 都沒有支援 icon","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:13:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":14,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":14,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Deotunvj6Nu","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Deotunvj6Nu","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"這次出國旅遊兩個多禮拜\n帶回接近 1tb 和 1500 分鐘的影片素材...\n一想到要整理跟剪接就完全沒動力\n\n想說如果 AI 和 Claude Opus 真的那麼強\n那就全部都丟給它處理吧\n整理素材 → 剪重點 → 加上資訊動畫\n\n整體心得：節奏還算及格，而且有亮點\n\n蠻會抓重點的，幾乎能辨識到畫面中重要的景點\n最喜歡的部分是資訊圖卡標出時間、現在在哪\n搭交通工具時會給路線小地圖\n健行時也會把路線跟高度都顯示在畫面上\n但 AI 對於解釋畫面的字幕還是會有點尬\n\n下方影片的畫面全都是靠 @insta360 的 GO Ultra\n蠻推薦出國旅遊時帶這種簡易小巧的廣角相機\n完全解放雙手！偶爾重要的景點還是會拿 iPhone 出來拍\n但這種行進間的畫面就能無腦讓相機來錄\n\n如果大家對這種 Vlog 怎麼做有興趣\n和 GO Ultra 搭配哪些配件 (還有慘痛教訓 = =)\n還有怎麼讓 AI 精準知道影片中的地點等等\n歡迎留言發問，會陸陸續續整理資訊出來～","timestamp":"2026-10-18T14:10:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":119,"replies":13,"reposts":2,"shares":58},"score":151,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[{"id":"Deq8brJmrzw","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ironv.careerlife/post/Deq8brJmrzw","username":"ironv.careerlife","displayName":"ironv.careerlife","content":"最近遇上 zeabur 準備關閉服務，想了解如何轉移的朋友，可以參考一下 Darrell 最新文章！  Translate\n\nReplying to @darrell_tw_","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:32:41.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Deq7p7qGihT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ironv.careerlife/post/Deq7p7qGihT","username":"ironv.careerlife","displayName":"ironv.careerlife","content":"剛剛看到 Vincent 新課程6000，創始會員直接賺爛，11/05 課程就火速上架，\n\n其實不用額外贈送，當初也準備刷，沒想到加入會員來能獲得這樣回饋，根本佛心企業。不知道另外3堂直播實戰是可以觀看還是加價購🤔\n\n之前訂閱曼報 pro ，有了孩子之後很難空出時間閱讀，推出 podcast 之後，洗小孩餵奶無痛學習，讓小孩可以提早接觸財金知識😆\n\n不知道以後會不會開發出幼兒財經，成為國民必備育兒教材","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:25:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":224,"replies":7,"reposts":1,"shares":20},"score":241,"first_seen":"2026-10-21T02:52:57+08:00","latest":true}]}]}